READ THE THREE VERDICTS IN THAT RUN TOGETHER. 'idle-since is unchanged across the
hold' PASSED and 'the park held for 90s' PASSED — both true, and both irrelevant,
because by the time the hold began the flap was over and the stamp that caused it had
been consumed by the bogus wake. Only the transition COUNT saw it. Lite's defect
erases its own evidence; forge's does not, which is why the same drill shape had to be
built differently for the two products.

